         <h2>The Non-Negotiables: Sleep, Nutrition, and Exercise</h2>
-        <p>No amount of fancy techniques can replace the fundamentals. Your brain is a physical organ, and it needs proper care to function at its peak. This is a topic we'll explore in-depth in our next post, <a href="https://studenttimepk.blogspot.com/2025/08/fueling-your-brain-for-success.html">"Fueling Your Brain: The Student's Guide to Nutrition and Focus."</a> For now, remember these three pillars of <a data-preview="" href="https://www.google.com/search?ved=1t:260882&amp;q=cognitive+health+definition&amp;bbid=8491425780932094856&amp;bpid=7980268954562766567" target="_blank">cognitive health</a>:</p>
+        <p>No amount of fancy techniques can replace the fundamentals. Your brain is a physical organ, and it needs proper care to function at its peak. This is a topic we'll explore in-depth in our next post, "Fueling Your Brain: The Student's Guide to Nutrition and Focus." For now, remember these three pillars of <a data-preview="" href="https://www.google.com/search?ved=1t:260882&amp;q=cognitive+health+definition&amp;bbid=8491425780932094856&amp;bpid=7980268954562766567" target="_blank">cognitive health</a>:</p>
         <ol>
             <li><strong>Sleep:</strong> It's during sleep that your brain consolidates and stores memories from the day. Pulling an all-nighter is the worst thing you can do for memory retention. Aim for 7-9 hours.</li>
             <li><strong>Nutrition:</strong> Your brain consumes a massive amount of energy. Foods rich in <a data-preview="" href="https://www.google.com/search?ved=1t:260882&amp;q=omega-3+fatty+acids+benefits&amp;bbid=8491425780932094856&amp;bpid=7980268954562766567" target="_blank">omega-3 fatty acids</a>, <a data-preview="" href="https://www.google.com/search?ved=1t:260882&amp;q=antioxidants+benefits&amp;bbid=8491425780932094856&amp;bpid=7980268954562766567" target="_blank">antioxidants</a>, and <a data-preview="" href="https://www.google.com/search?ved=1t:260882&amp;q=B-vitamins+benefits&amp;bbid=8491425780932094856&amp;bpid=7980268954562766567" target="_blank">B-vitamins</a> are its fuel.</li>
